{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"raku","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Raku","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Raku (.raku .rakumod .rakudoc .p6).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"raku","name":"Raku","extensions":[".raku",".rakumod",".rakudoc",".p6",".pl6",".pm6"],"grammar":"grammars/raku.json","lineComment":"#","blockComment":["#`(",")"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Raku","path":"snippets/raku.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/raku.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"#`\\\\(\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\)\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"=begin pod\",\n      \"end\": \"=end pod\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[$@%&][*!.?^=:]?[A-Za-z_][\\\\w-]*\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"=>|<=>|\\\\.\\\\.\\\\.?|\\\\|\\\\||&&|~~|===?\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:whenever|grammar|package|require|default|method|module|unless|repeat|return|orwith|gather|supply|state|multi|proto|class|elsif|given|while|until|catch|react|start|await|role|need|else|when|loop|last|next|redo|does|then|take|our|has|sub|use|for|try|die|my|if|do|is|of|as)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:False|True|Nil)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Callable|Complex|Array|Range|Bool|List|Hash|Code|Int|Str|Num|Map|Any|Rat|Seq|Set|Bag|Mix|Mu)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:sprintf|reverse|printf|print|split|note|grep|sort|join|say|put|map|dd|lc|uc)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/raku.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Sub\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sub\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"sub ${1:name}(${2:\\\\$x}) {\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A subroutine\"\n  },\n  \"Class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"class\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"    has ${2:\\\\$.field};\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  },\n  \"For loop\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"for\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for ${1:@items} -> ${2:\\\\$item} {\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"for\"\n  },\n  \"Say\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"say\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"say ${1:\\\"hello\\\"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"say\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Raku\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Raku.\n\n## Files\n\n`.raku`, `.rakumod`, `.rakudoc`, `.p6`, `.pl6`, `.pm6`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `sub` | A subroutine |\n| `class` | A class |\n| `for` | for |\n| `say` | say |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}